{"schemaVersion":"galpedia-static-detail-model-v1","dataRevision":"a0c0367b8270b080feef0ef1fe65522144dc62343feb9d752729d92867d0d639","workId":"25110","model":{"presentationWorkId":"vndb:v21009","staff":{"artwork":[{"creditedName":"トラノタヌキ","creatorId":"vndb:s12260","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:3619","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s12260","name":"トラノタヌキ","roleCode":"artwork","roleLabel":"原画","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:184472","source":"egs"}],"scenario":[{"creditedName":"かりや喫茶","creatorId":"vndb:s12261","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:3620","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s12261","name":"かりや喫茶","roleCode":"scenario","roleLabel":"剧本","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:184473","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"河口歩平","creatorId":"vndb:s12980","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:19021","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s12980","name":"河口歩平","roleCode":"scenario","roleLabel":"剧本","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:184474","source":"egs"}],"music":[{"creditedName":"野山鉄心","creatorId":"vndb:s12981","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:21403","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s12981","name":"野山鉄心","roleCode":"music","roleLabel":"作品音乐","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:184487","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"Notzan ACT","creatorId":"vndb:s9697","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:14284","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s9697","name":"Notzan ACT","roleCode":"music","roleLabel":"作品音乐","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:184488","source":"egs"}],"other":[]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_vndb_c60233","characterName":"二階堂 久美子","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c60233"},"originalCharacterName":"二階堂 久美子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"37"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is one of the protegees of Shuichiro Ayukawa, the general manager of the Ayukawa Group, a fixer who is said to still have tremendous influence over huge corporations throughout the country even in his old age."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"With huge capital and threats, she forced a medium-sized food processing company, where the main character works, to give up its CEO position."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"In accordance with the distorted imperialism that he had been drilled into her, she dragged down rival companies, slashed compensation for employees, and forced them to work beyond their limits, and in just a few years, the company recovered and developed to the point where it was considered a major corporation."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"However, the dissatisfaction and fatigue of the protagonists and other employees working for the company that has become such a black company steadily accumulates. Furthermore, Kumiko Nikaidou's unmanageable behavior and mindless abusive language erodes the hearts and minds of the employees."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"One day, a problem involving foreign substances occurs at the food processing plant where the protagonist is in charge. Kumiko Nikaidou is summoned to the president's office as the person responsible for the enormous loss to the company, and she looks at the protagonist as if she were looking at trash."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c60233"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/71/71a9f3cb58ef345cd9c7cb517d240d62d08009ead6a6a74d6a2ec89f6097ed67.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f0/f00c277326aeb5bd4ace53209dde2958ae3ed1b1ad092c1a6b9f02295ab1aecb.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"柊 真冬","creatorId":"vndb:s339","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s339","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s339","name":"椎那 天","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:73664","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c60234","characterName":"高月 華梨","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c60234"},"originalCharacterName":"高月 華梨","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"31"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"An excellent and beautiful secretary who assists President Nikaidoi."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is first-rate in both appearance and ability, and is trusted by Kumiko Nikaidou. However, she has a weak emotional expression, and is described by the employees as being like a robot."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"However, she is gives off a bad impression for the main character as she is an object of resentment, hatred, and awe from President Nikaidou's side."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Despite her beautiful appearance, she is an S-Queen who turns her cruelty against masochists without mercy. and this time, her fangs will be turned on someone she never expected..."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c60234"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/10/1050429c091583ffb4ec03ac153c5dbe84aeba5d9d6d3f3c607fda6050b84efe.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/38/382d28163f3b826b05f300343e10065efb1fb47fc43cc7551aa08dfb8049b3d4.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"そらまめ。","creatorId":"vndb:s2143","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2143","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2143","name":"和鳴 るせ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:73663","source":"vndb"}]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p1566","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:2303","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p1566","name":"木琴Soft","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-brand:25110:2303","source":"egs"},{"companyId":"vndb:p1566","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p1566","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p1566","name":"木琴Soft","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:58152:v21009","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p1566","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p1566","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p1566","name":"木琴Soft","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:58153:v21009","source":"vndb"}],"missingStates":["confirmed-character-relation-missing","current-runtime-cover-unavailable"],"source":"terminal-wiki-full-runtime-v7"}}
